# ReplacementLayer order is Control, Copy, Other (CR 616.1): a card entering
# as a copy takes the copy first, and Containment Priest's Other-layer
# "exile it instead" then reads the copy, not the card as printed.
# Zombify returns Phyrexian Metamorph (an artifact creature) uncast. It enters
# as a copy of the opponent's Bonesplitter, an Equipment: no creature, so the
# Priest's ValidCard$ Creature.!token+!wasCast no longer matches and it enters.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 3 B
tapformana human 4 B
tapformana human 5 B
tapformana human 6 B
queue paygeneric B
queue paygeneric B
queue paygeneric B
queue targets 7
queue confirmeffect true
queue cardchoice 8
castspell human 1
resolvestack
